    LLM: "Save high trumps for defense. Don't waste them on low non-trumps unless necessary. Try to attack with pairs if allowed (to force defender to use two good cards).\n\nHand Management: Keep a variety of suits to avoid being forced to trump unnecessarily.\n\nCard Counting: Remember which trumps have been played. If the Ace of Trumps is gone, the King is boss.",
